    {
      "fileName": "prayer-attack.json",
      "id": "AtpMrGXaMPJtDIDR",
      "name": "Prayer Attack",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "AtpMrGXaMPJtDIDR",
        "folder": "rflJeg6ROfDA17xf",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Prayer Attack",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a sawtooth saber in each hand.</p><hr /><p>You've mastered the signature assassination style of the Red Mantis. Attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Feint] an enemy within 30 feet. If your Feint is successful, when you use Prayer Attack on subsequent turns you automatically make the target @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against your melee attacks for that turn without rolling a check to Feint, so long as you remain visible to the target and the target remains within 30 feet of you. If you use your Prayer Attack against a different target, you must attempt to Feint the target normally.</p>\n<p>When you use Prayer Attack, your next successful Strike with a sawtooth saber that turn deals 2d6 persistent bleed damage to the target.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 14
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Red Mantis Assassin Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Adventure: Prey for Death"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "domain": "damage",
              "key": "RollOption",
              "option": "prayer-attack",
              "toggleable": true
            },
            {
              "damageType": "bleed",
              "diceNumber": 2,
              "dieSize": "d6",
              "key": "DamageDice",
              "predicate": [
                "item:base:sawtooth-saber",
                "prayer-attack"
              ],
              "selector": "strike-damage"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
